WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.868 --> 00:00:01.968
-Every time you come on,

00:00:01.968 --> 00:00:03.100
you always do something
above and beyond.

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:04.501
Thank you for playing
that game with us.

00:00:04.501 --> 00:00:06.267
And I always kind of
put you to the test

00:00:06.267 --> 00:00:07.868
and make you do impressions
or something.

00:00:07.868 --> 00:00:09.667
I know -- You're like,
"I know, Jimmy.

00:00:09.667 --> 00:00:11.033
I have a job
on 'Saturday Night Live.'

00:00:11.033 --> 00:00:12.601
"I don't need to audition."
-They're just impressions.

00:00:12.601 --> 00:00:15.033
-But I do love your impressions.
-Okay.

00:00:15.033 --> 00:00:17.067
-And I was wondering
if you could do a bunch of them

00:00:17.067 --> 00:00:19.200
and how many
you could do in 60 seconds.

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:21.501
If I just name the names,
could you just do a little --

00:00:21.501 --> 00:00:23.033
Even if it's a snippet.
-A snippet?

00:00:23.033 --> 00:00:24.667
-Just a little sound effect,

00:00:24.667 --> 00:00:27.133
something of the names of
people that you do.

00:00:27.133 --> 00:00:28.300
Is that possible?
-Yeah.

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:31.567
I want to get as many
as humanly possible.

00:00:31.567 --> 00:00:33.033
I'm a competitor.
-Alright.

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:35.400
Alright, let's --
Let's go. Alright, ready?

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:38.000
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:39.601
-Alright.
-Okay.

00:00:39.601 --> 00:00:41.601
-60 seconds on the clock.
Ready?

00:00:41.601 --> 00:00:43.000
Go! Meryl Streep.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:47.267
-Oh, well, I have 600 Oscars.

00:00:48.434 --> 00:00:53.767
Jimmy, you and I
are kindred spirits.

00:00:55.200 --> 00:01:01.033
You know, you asked me on a date
once, and you said "norr."

00:01:02.534 --> 00:01:05.334
Y'all, I just freakin'
love Oprah.

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:10.501
[ Laughs ]
Na, na, na, na.

00:01:11.634 --> 00:01:14.467
Oh.
[ Laughs ]

00:01:15.267 --> 00:01:17.267
Yaaaas!

00:01:18.100 --> 00:01:20.667
Oh. Okay, pretend I have knives.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:27.033
Whoa! Jimmy Fallon!
It is crazy that I'm here!

00:01:27.033 --> 00:01:29.767
Oh, and I have a bow!

00:01:31.133 --> 00:01:32.501
